      "value": "Please also consider if possible to fix being unable to maintain gestures via trackpad and/or bound to trigger via advanced controls while moving/turning.\nThis was a very welcome feature and functionality that no longer works the same. You can still maintain a gesture while holding trigger (advanced controls) but using same controller to move and/or turn disables gestures.",
