  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-14T12:06:03.969Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have compiled a list of regressions that I have observed while testing on Vive wands on Live and Avatars3-Beta branch, with both Vive advanced controls disabled and Vive advanced controls enabled.\nThe regressions boil down to:\n- Vive advanced controls turned ON can no longer perform analog fist gestures\n- Vive advanced controls turned OFF has completely regressed, such as the grip button having a lower priority than the trackpad, fist not triggering automatically when pressing the trigger, gestures not persisting when the thumb is released from the trackpad\n- Thumbs up is missing from the wheel, whereas handopen has appeared on the trackpad\n\nI'm unable to tell which of these changes might have been intentional.",
